The '''Goblin Raid''' is an active event that can happen in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Mechanics ==
During the event, [[Goblin Raid#Enemies|Goblin Raiders]] of different types will start to spawn in waves through a designated area. The aim of the event is to kill {{Red|500-1,000}} [[Goblin Raid#Enemies|Goblins]] in {{Green|5}} minutes. 

=== Rewards ===
*Each [[Goblin Raid#Enemies|Goblin Raider]] slain counts for {{red|1}} kill.
**Regular Goblins do not count towards this counter, even if they are slain in the target area. However, they count towards the [[Commissions#Dwarven_Mines_Commissions|Goblin Raid Slayer Commission]].
*Each {{MobSprite|Superprotectron}} slain counts for {{red|10}} kills.
**All contributors will receive the rewards.

