== Tips ==
* A good strategy for the Goblin Raid event is to quickly move to {{MobSprite|Superprotectron;Superprotectrons}} and hit them once, greatly increasing kill count and still letting other players have a chance to hit them.
{{Main|Mithril Powder#Increasing Mithril Powder Gain}}
*Players can use the {{Reforge|Royal}} reforge to increase their gain of {{Mithril Powder}} from this and other [[Mining Events]].
* {{MobSprite|Murderlover;Murderlovers}} are lethal to early game players because : 
**of their High {{stat|Hp}}, {{stat|dmg}} and Attack Speed
**they spawn bundled with a Goblin wave, making them hard to hit while they are able to kill you in mere seconds.

== Trivia ==
*There used to be a bug where upon a lobby failing a Goblin Raid, the fail message in chat would display an incorrect number of minutes that had passed.

